      "questionId": "qe-c12-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-s008",
      "sentenceText": "You can see your struggles from a different perspective, and the new interpretation of those struggles becomes a foundational step toward self-understanding and further transformation.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4f32421df46e2582736747a705530bc7c39b65356d18df9d68dc719cc862ea4c",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "718bfa7351ccf7bb26f40fb64999d600ef3c20284306ca045d1791884fecfb24",
      "passageSha256": "cc66612a63ddfadc67508b304d1250f8da0e88f29257535918164d1e8dd94d2c",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Edit your story, drop the old version of yourself, and come to believe in the new version of your narrative.",
      "sentenceSha256": "94cf0b1e8bcf1ec0f02596bc30bd0aeccda600b7d13bb1713c28ad8e6a7ca4f0",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-01140-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-031",
      "parentFingerprint": "718bfa7351ccf7bb26f40fb64999d600ef3c20284306ca045d1791884fecfb24",
      "passageSha256": "cc66612a63ddfadc67508b304d1250f8da0e88f29257535918164d1e8dd94d2c",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-s003",
      "sentenceText": "But if you’ve had some unusual experiences such as an earthquake or hurricane or tough periods in your life, you could edit them to make them more interesting to you and others.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7d2a4cb0a9a4b9fac507a8d7b2416bbdbb86765b40cda570c106dea64235d558",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "9ecfd9d1bea4fd8c4b11f4c045973c3cf472d0b35f01bfb0e069f081a42d200f",
      "passageSha256": "ddd92efb58c5c665e402de6d69179ce8321f482d49d57c0f353b44b0977bc40a",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-s004",
      "sentenceText": "That will then become part of your story and who you are.",
      "sentenceSha256": "08d9afd4e53b89323a19ceaad23fa8bef3aaa634ad871f5bd8fa77385bb09319",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "9ecfd9d1bea4fd8c4b11f4c045973c3cf472d0b35f01bfb0e069f081a42d200f",
      "passageSha256": "ddd92efb58c5c665e402de6d69179ce8321f482d49d57c0f353b44b0977bc40a",
      "pdfPages": [
        138
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Unless you have a life full of interesting experiences, it is not going to be a psychologically rich one.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7bf6f2ffd859f026ffdc4ef6ee538579ccf0ce2ce90e92ae8181ca72cf4b4a7e",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "44ede07a78f1900ef5381d3f5381e296f59430ab7829adf2a109e9058a37798f",
      "passageSha256": "f7b6ea692c50b125da37ead538ded14f76911977c2244467ffbf04277d997842",
      "pdfPages": [
        138,
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-s007",
      "sentenceText": "But if you become a better “story editor,” you can extract the most interesting aspects of your experiences and make your story psychologically richer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "181549d86055acd35b8480189ccc431947abf628d90667f9491f22c1ecf9ebc7",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s03-p138-05625-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "44ede07a78f1900ef5381d3f5381e296f59430ab7829adf2a109e9058a37798f",
      "passageSha256": "f7b6ea692c50b125da37ead538ded14f76911977c2244467ffbf04277d997842",
      "pdfPages": [
        138,
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-01650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Over the last forty years, the psychologist Dan McAdams has studied “narrative identity,” or how people tell their life stories, using a method called the “Life Story Interview.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "0746f79bf56f9d10cf68b64c95e522b68fab7abf2a6128d14a5c5912a0105791",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "8ab2348d4b9e276de447ba4eb35ac29ad38e960d16418f467cc92a51d24677d9",
      "passageSha256": "a4c7382b02d5055e03832641e1c2cdfcf6a63d553b8fe92bae6c7aedb53de474",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-01650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Imagine that the book has a table of contents containing the titles of the main chapters in the story.",
      "sentenceSha256": "85c32c7937ff79a73978722980eeab03526257322861d318259c0b4120077c95",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "8ab2348d4b9e276de447ba4eb35ac29ad38e960d16418f467cc92a51d24677d9",
      "passageSha256": "a4c7382b02d5055e03832641e1c2cdfcf6a63d553b8fe92bae6c7aedb53de474",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-s002",
      "sentenceText": "What was the low point?",
      "sentenceSha256": "c0f5f2503f52751d95e82083a5d5b35d921f5f9c6eeade58465403184c28abff",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "d204ac05608e190065d68d0c1b5b84c32d656fa931e9ed85a5af6bf404ab1ef9",
      "passageSha256": "6b3999ff2ff6fc6cc5165bd85253ac88c11de85c3e2920b0dd0de0f495e2a994",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-s003",
      "sentenceText": "What was the turning point?",
      "sentenceSha256": "b2004ba31a297fa96e26e7596192e1791cb2b43a09c15dbd52e5cba95dae7c4f",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "d204ac05608e190065d68d0c1b5b84c32d656fa931e9ed85a5af6bf404ab1ef9",
      "passageSha256": "6b3999ff2ff6fc6cc5165bd85253ac88c11de85c3e2920b0dd0de0f495e2a994",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Can you name a positive childhood memory?",
      "sentenceSha256": "88d9ff2e662678027380b064f35f76ecfc90a3438f76dcab0c85eaa1bbee095e",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-037",
      "parentFingerprint": "d204ac05608e190065d68d0c1b5b84c32d656fa931e9ed85a5af6bf404ab1ef9",
      "passageSha256": "6b3999ff2ff6fc6cc5165bd85253ac88c11de85c3e2920b0dd0de0f495e2a994",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-04185-s002",
      "sentenceText": "What are your dreams, hopes, and plans?",
      "sentenceSha256": "8a93ba3ef0c43dd0c11ee7b8a5e5ffd34389ae4e228e78e48c2b7541386c6f87",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-039",
      "parentFingerprint": "5b8bf85b1cc643ae268ab521155bb787119bfdf3b2c9dd36d1a005b34287b711",
      "passageSha256": "ce12b3c6f15bc7169c608063a205522a8b74e9cd31c060c26a1d0fd90ad63906",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "There are many ways to classify narratives, but two main types are the redemption narrative and the contamination narrative.",
      "sentenceSha256": "90c1dc9090474623c98eadd0adade4e82b17d96adc40c1b22fc2d79482426e17",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "35599fe8b5c8ca0da5d5243cccfc4c488140b10630990c19c0d59b53a2301aef",
      "passageSha256": "db78834148866f38f6afbc163b54157999cdf5bbdca273e7500af4adac47ec23",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-s003",
      "sentenceText": "G.W.’s story was so prototypical that McAdams even wrote a book entitled George W. Bush and the Redemptive Dream.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7b14efbe61068db3deb054dd8012e319878d8e1b8f7aac0133211ab687e6d97a",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "35599fe8b5c8ca0da5d5243cccfc4c488140b10630990c19c0d59b53a2301aef",
      "passageSha256": "db78834148866f38f6afbc163b54157999cdf5bbdca273e7500af4adac47ec23",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-s004",
      "sentenceText": "The other archetype is a contamination narrative, where people tell a story that starts out good but goes south after a certain point.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eb8c2e2d9f692a8501487e14a786a79b4dc9d0e023b057648a0819b20773b7c8",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "35599fe8b5c8ca0da5d5243cccfc4c488140b10630990c19c0d59b53a2301aef",
      "passageSha256": "db78834148866f38f6afbc163b54157999cdf5bbdca273e7500af4adac47ec23",
      "pdfPages": [
        139
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Narrative identity, or how we tell our life stories, is associated with various personality traits.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f93eea5b22012f8630858b7e9a8a4a752fc85163068ffad3332fa9e135fa299e",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "11bd19c2ee31707cf43768d1751e647490759ee3ab36f13d19cd34831348b841",
      "passageSha256": "04c5d6090bb71cf6039bd02789f62ba14e8fb4a577e583d55bf854950ff9e45d",
      "pdfPages": [
        139,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For example, individuals who tell a redemptive story report themselves to be more conscientious, agreeable, extraverted, and less neurotic than those who do not.",
      "sentenceSha256": "62fbad48d6f380629019a8b88424d6dc9d37e0469a9e847e651c65d56ac80f49",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "11bd19c2ee31707cf43768d1751e647490759ee3ab36f13d19cd34831348b841",
      "passageSha256": "04c5d6090bb71cf6039bd02789f62ba14e8fb4a577e583d55bf854950ff9e45d",
      "pdfPages": [
        139,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-s003",
      "sentenceText": "The emotional tone of a life narrative is more positive among agreeable, conscientious, and non-neurotic people than among disagreeable, unconscientious, and neurotic people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "502403878a32178c755561e180e43227dac15fa9465e680e9503ca7fb8ed9d4d",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p139-06720-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "11bd19c2ee31707cf43768d1751e647490759ee3ab36f13d19cd34831348b841",
      "passageSha256": "04c5d6090bb71cf6039bd02789f62ba14e8fb4a577e583d55bf854950ff9e45d",
      "pdfPages": [
        139,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0060",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Recent studies also show that the perspective of a life story changes the way people tell it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "69f04e9f9b596b158c250328c61b0b58cb9dc30307706a76a552394c10c1f983",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "9fa22a87c41700dadfbca8774b37996db8e5cd5ed887d66cc01df8af276bcb61",
      "passageSha256": "35b64e13b7d6e43c56245c5d66ef81c085149f20a140a9df955663f42ff789bd",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0061",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, Benjamin Rogers and colleagues asked half of a group of participants a series of questions such as: “What makes you you?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "35dca3999b97fc4676064c93d18de8a43fe961d9d979b40d7df26c146f3aae74",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "9fa22a87c41700dadfbca8774b37996db8e5cd5ed887d66cc01df8af276bcb61",
      "passageSha256": "35b64e13b7d6e43c56245c5d66ef81c085149f20a140a9df955663f42ff789bd",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0062",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s005",
      "sentenceText": "“What challenges or obstacles, such as a nemesis/rival or negative event, stood in the way of your journey?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "0958bdd67b04f75b242a327a98c5be57c6e3186db4cb790b78c83c58dc3c561a",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "724d34c8929f3ba277808eccee579649d0699d173afa59c9d3a502009834b73f",
      "passageSha256": "fb1395a5e5220e3a1eae28b61d066bd7ada4106c5e1fb3d5d45d5de4d4957802",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0063",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s006",
      "sentenceText": "“How did you personally grow as part of your journey to become who you are today?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "ceed960d6336083acf372ad4b25b9fe6840795d183025641101b937450995c3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "724d34c8929f3ba277808eccee579649d0699d173afa59c9d3a502009834b73f",
      "passageSha256": "fb1395a5e5220e3a1eae28b61d066bd7ada4106c5e1fb3d5d45d5de4d4957802",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0064",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s007",
      "sentenceText": "“In what ways has your journey left a legacy?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "162df84ad53eb697e592d3f0d5d18e300a9e95a01d4cc49965c221588cbc95d9",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "724d34c8929f3ba277808eccee579649d0699d173afa59c9d3a502009834b73f",
      "passageSha256": "fb1395a5e5220e3a1eae28b61d066bd7ada4106c5e1fb3d5d45d5de4d4957802",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0065",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-s009",
      "sentenceText": "The other half of participants were asked a series of mundane questions such as, “Tell us various features of your life…such as your work and home.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "f2ec123ea7d0c3d1bdd4b06f904f9690619f8688a294ee52e971e96f24f750bf",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s04-p140-01920-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c12-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "23c5fb1154cd9fe38afdf28cec0120af40a1b7204092d80c065d95ba04fe0c93",
      "passageSha256": "30785e5a28286fb2b6be76c291301573dbc0beeec22f0a2714763728b710264f",
      "pdfPages": [
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c12-0066",
      "sentenceId": "c12-s05-p140-05940-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Memory is key to a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "18ede018cc3c8adc6b0cbef3460851593e2ed35b560d28c69394aebe965da5cb",
      "readingUnitId": "c12-s05-p140-05940-r001-004",
